<title>USA: Clinicor names Amy Russell acting CFO.</title>
<headline>Clinicor names Amy Russell acting CFO.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Clinicor Inc on Tuesday said its chief financial officer, Susan Georgen-Saad, will leave Clinicor to become CFO of IntelliQuest Information Inc. Clinicor named controller Amy Russell as acting chief financial officer until a successor is named.</p>
<p>Clinicor, a provider of clinical research services to the pharmaceutical, biotechnology and medical device industries, said the moves are effective March 17.</p>
</text>
